%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 24cee7e49fc532a45ab71bd5ace6cb7b, type: 3}
  m_Name: S1post
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  lines:
  - hasDialogue: 1
    speakerNameEN: Tessa
    dialogueTextEN: Water's started coming up. That's enough.
    speakerNameKR: "\uD14C\uC0AC"
    dialogueTextKR: "\uBB3C\uC774 \uB098\uC624\uAE30 \uC2DC\uC791\uD588\uC5B4. \uC774
      \uC815\uB3C4\uBA74 \uCDA9\uBD84\uD574."
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 804f4937427d73c438fd059b9f112a8f, type: 3}
    changeBackground: 1
    background: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 67b5dd471d2fdea4eb0322b8c9ef0b5b, type: 3}
    changePanel: 0
    characterPanel: {fileID: 0}
    changeBgm: 0
    bgm: {fileID: 0}
  - hasDialogue: 1
    speakerNameEN: Tessa
    dialogueTextEN: But across, down, uh... "squares"? What in the world does that
      mean?
    speakerNameKR: "\uD14C\uC0AC"
    dialogueTextKR: "\uADFC\uB370 \uAC00\uB85C, \uC138\uB85C, \uC74C... '\uCE78'?
      \uADF8\uAC8C \uB3C4\uB300\uCCB4 \uBB34\uC2A8 \uB9D0\uC774\uC57C?"
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: bc1b5bc7d393d224688d63ec912bbeeb, type: 3}
    changeBackground: 0
    background: {fileID: 0}
    changePanel: 0
    characterPanel: {fileID: 0}
    changeBgm: 0
    bgm: {fileID: 0}
  - hasDialogue: 1
    speakerNameEN: Piper
    dialogueTextEN: Who knows, hehe. Maybe they only show up in my mind's eye.
    speakerNameKR: "\uD30C\uC774\uD37C"
    dialogueTextKR: "\uAE00\uC384\uC694, \uD788\uD788. \uC81C \uB9C8\uC74C\uC18D
      \uB208\uC73C\uB85C\uB9CC \uBCF4\uC774\uB294 \uAC78\uC9C0\uB3C4\uC694."
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 312af029b1b084a41ade9a6fdf1a6418, type: 3}
    changeBackground: 0
    background: {fileID: 0}
    changePanel: 0
    characterPanel: {fileID: 0}
    changeBgm: 0
    bgm: {fileID: 0}
  - hasDialogue: 1
    speakerNameEN: Tessa
    dialogueTextEN: Right, naturally. No wonder you're this good at the job when
      you've barely started.
    speakerNameKR: "\uD14C\uC0AC"
    dialogueTextKR: "\uADF8\uB798, \uC5B4\uB828\uD558\uACA0\uC5B4. \uC5B4\uCA50\uC9C0
      \uC2DC\uC791\uD55C \uC9C0 \uC5BC\uB9C8 \uB418\uC9C0\uB3C4 \uC54A\uC558\uC73C\uBA74\uC11C
      \uC77C\uC744 \uADF8\uB807\uAC8C \uC798\uD558\uB354\uB2C8."
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 00390391673ce4c42996757871825105, type: 3}
    changeBackground: 0
    background: {fileID: 0}
    changePanel: 0
    characterPanel: {fileID: 0}
    changeBgm: 0
    bgm: {fileID: 0}
  - hasDialogue: 1
    speakerNameEN: Tessa
    dialogueTextEN: There's always a wall with geniuses, I swear...
    speakerNameKR: "\uD14C\uC0AC"
    dialogueTextKR: "\uC774\uB798\uC11C \uCC9C\uC7AC\uB4E4\uC5D0\uAC90 \uBCBD\uC774
      \uB290\uAEF4\uC9C4\uB2E4\uB2C8\uAE4C, \uC815\uB9D0\uB85C..."
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 09aff2867ae9ee3479addb17d5a880eb, type: 3}
    changeBackground: 0
    background: {fileID: 0}
    changePanel: 0
    characterPanel: {fileID: 0}
    changeBgm: 0
    bgm: {fileID: 0}
  - hasDialogue: 1
    speakerNameEN: Piper
    dialogueTextEN: Come on, let's move. We should find the next well we can actually
      wake before evening!
    speakerNameKR: "\uD30C\uC774\uD37C"
    dialogueTextKR: "\uC5BC\uB978 \uCD9C\uBC1C\uD574\uC694. \uC800\uB141 \uC804\uAE4C\uC9C0\uB294
      \uB6AB\uB9B4 \uB9CC\uD55C \uB2E4\uC74C \uC6B0\uBB3C\uC744 \uCC3E\uC544\uBD10\uC57C\uC8E0!"
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: b01f092eb0545574db7d43f93e64aba7, type: 3}
    changeBackground: 0
    background: {fileID: 0}
    changePanel: 0
    characterPanel: {fileID: 0}
    changeBgm: 0
    bgm: {fileID: 0}
  - hasDialogue: 1
    speakerNameEN: Tessa
    dialogueTextEN: Yeah, yeah... That endless energy is something to envy, too.
    speakerNameKR: "\uD14C\uC0AC"
    dialogueTextKR: "\uADF8\uB798 \uADF8\uB798... \uADF8 \uB118\uCE58\uB294 \uC5D0\uB108\uC9C0\uB3C4
      \uCC38 \uBD80\uB7EC\uC6CC."
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 9efc6fe7a790fc8428194a75c40098e7, type: 3}
    changeBackground: 0
    background: {fileID: 0}
    changePanel: 0
    characterPanel: {fileID: 0}
    changeBgm: 0
    bgm: {fileID: 0}
  - hasDialogue: 1
    speakerNameEN: Tessa
    dialogueTextEN: Huh. What's this?
    speakerNameKR: "\uD14C\uC0AC"
    dialogueTextKR: "\uC5B4, \uC774\uAC74 \uBB50\uC9C0?"
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: d10acede0f7e8e5489ec70da230be6c6, type: 3}
    changeBackground: 0
    background: {fileID: 0}
    changePanel: 0
    characterPanel: {fileID: 0}
    changeBgm: 0
    bgm: {fileID: 0}
  - hasDialogue: 1
    speakerNameEN: Piper
    dialogueTextEN: What's wrong?
    speakerNameKR: "\uD30C\uC774\uD37C"
    dialogueTextKR: "\uC65C \uADF8\uB798\uC694?"
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: ce46d5e3f69096f4a84f9897353ff324, type: 3}
    changeBackground: 0
    background: {fileID: 0}
    changePanel: 0
    characterPanel: {fileID: 0}
    changeBgm: 0
    bgm: {fileID: 0}
  - hasDialogue: 1
    speakerNameEN: Tessa
    dialogueTextEN: Nothing. Let's go.
    speakerNameKR: "\uD14C\uC0AC"
    dialogueTextKR: "\uC544\uBB34\uAC83\uB3C4 \uC544\uB2C8\uC57C. \uCD9C\uBC1C\uD558\uC790."
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 9efc6fe7a790fc8428194a75c40098e7, type: 3}
    changeBackground: 0
    background: {fileID: 0}
    changePanel: 0
    characterPanel: {fileID: 0}
    changeBgm: 0
    bgm: {fileID: 0}
